      ":question/problem": "The functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ are differentiable on an open interval containing $x = 7$. The values of $f$, $g$, and their respective derivatives are shown in the following table:\n\n| $x$ | $f(x)$ | $f^{\u2032}(x)$ | $g(x)$ | $g^{\u2032}(x)$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $7$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n\nFind $lim_(x \u2192 7)(f(x))/(x^{2}g(x))$."
